<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Large turnover in Fairfax shares.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Large turnover in Fairfax shares.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in newspaper group John Fairfax Holdings Ltd were near the top of the turnover list on Friday with 8.6 million shares or about 1.1 percent of the company's ordinary shares traded.</p>
<p>The bulk of the trade was in 12 lines of shares specialled by J.B. Were, a broker said to be acting for News Corp Ltd which earlier confirmed it had disposed of all its Fairfax shares.  </p>
<p>The specials, totalling 5.795 million shares, were all at price of A$2.78 per share.</p>
<p>Fairfax shares closed a cent higher at A$2.79 on turnover of 9.78 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Walter Watson 61-2 9373 1810</p>
</text>
